# MultiRisk AI

Intelligent Multi-Disease Future Risk Prediction System Based on Deep Learning

## Diseases
- Type 2 Diabetes
- Cardiovascular Disease
- Alzheimer's / Dementia

## Project Structure
- `data/` — Dataset storage (diabetes, cardiovascular, alzheimers)
- `src/` — Source code (disease-specific modules, ML API, backend)
- `notebooks/` — Jupyter notebooks for EDA and research
- `models/` — Trained models
- `tests/` — Unit tests
- `docs/` — Documentation
- `config/` — Configuration files